<title>USA: Sioux City hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs up $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was moderately active. Compared with Monday, barrows and gilts were $0.50 higher. Top $59.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   220-270 lbs     59.00-59.50</p>
<p>		 270-280 lbs     58.50-59.00</p>
<p>    US 2-3   280-300 lbs     56.50-58.00</p>
<p>    US 3-4   300-330 lbs     54.00-56.00</p>
<p>  Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $52.00.</p>
<p>    US 1-3   300-400 lbs     46.00</p>
<p>		 400-450 lbs     47.50</p>
<p>		 450-500 lbs     50.00</p>
<p>		 500-550 lbs     51.00</p>
<p>		 550-700 lbs     52.00</p>
</text>
